{"3541210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One More Run", "steam_appid": 3541210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Expansive, Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Run features a fully explorable, hand-crafted world with many unique biomes to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/6177f4f36cdb011b28bd7c3e379fb6e9.poster.avif?t=1782715921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/6177f4f36cdb011b28bd7c3e379fb6e9.webm?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/6177f4f36cdb011b28bd7c3e379fb6e9.mp4?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World Remembers Your Actions, and Changes as You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous events that can unfold from run to run as direct consequences of your actions. Many of these outcomes can semi-permanently reshape the map, change the enemies you'll face, or change other core elements of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/1fd51830d9cac1bfc7421fee1d648e8d.poster.avif?t=1782715921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/1fd51830d9cac1bfc7421fee1d648e8d.webm?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/1fd51830d9cac1bfc7421fee1d648e8d.mp4?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay Powerful Bosses to Fuel Your Skill Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill points are gained through overcoming challenges, <i>not</i> EXP grinding. Bringing down the strongest bosses opens up unique, build-defining abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/b8ab41a8c73373f676ef3212c803e623.poster.avif?t=1782715921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/b8ab41a8c73373f676ef3212c803e623.webm?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/b8ab41a8c73373f676ef3212c803e623.mp4?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Punchy, Satisfying Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto attacks and active abilities have been carefully designed to feel satisfying to use, and synergize meaningfully with the build choices that you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/5acfe7ca6ff482807980e83a099f0faa.poster.avif?t=1782715921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/5acfe7ca6ff482807980e83a099f0faa.webm?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/5acfe7ca6ff482807980e83a099f0faa.mp4?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Deep and Rewarding Crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARPG item-based progression is deeply integrated into the game's design. Modules are dropped from boss farming or long-survival runs, and then deterministically crafted for a satisfying meta progression experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/bb4926b63b78a956a0c11da800ed4987.poster.avif?t=1782715921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/bb4926b63b78a956a0c11da800ed4987.webm?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/bb4926b63b78a956a0c11da800ed4987.mp4?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And of course, Meme Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Survivors-Like DNA is still intact. There's loads of ways to break the game through unique builds, and numerous leaderboards to show off your results on.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Expansive, Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Run features a fully explorable, hand-crafted world with many unique biomes to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/6177f4f36cdb011b28bd7c3e379fb6e9.poster.avif?t=1782715921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/6177f4f36cdb011b28bd7c3e379fb6e9.webm?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541210/extras/6177f4f36cdb011b28bd7c3e379fb6e9.mp4?t=1782715921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World Remembers Your Actions, and Changes as You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous ev